  way through Café Q\, The Pub\, Fernando's\, and Dive Bar. At each stop\,
  enjoy a bespoke cocktail or zero proof option crafted exclusively for the
  occasion\, showcasing the unique character of each space. Beer and wine s
 elections will also be available throughout the evening.\n\nEnjoy 25–30 
 minutes at each venue - a dynamic experience which offers the perfect oppo
 rtunity to explore familiar favorites while mingling with fellow members a
 long the way.\n\n*This event is offered at $72 per member\, plus tax\, and
